 loading=\"lazy\" /> at <em>t</em> = 40 ms is _________ A. (Rounded off to two decimal places)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/7b7e9067be9564dc4d76ce4426ce72fda3768b11.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"3.4","high":"3.6"},"solution":"<p>\n 3.449 (3.40 - 3.60)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/7e403f2ebf719c168f361f014ea33e322fb94981.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/d1f1dcd728a88f5e94fa7865b636d6ac2d04c999.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":8,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>\n For the circuit shown below, if R = 2 kΩ then the maximum power transferred to the load <em>R<sub>L</sub></em> is ________ mW. (Rounded off to two decimal places)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/ed086eb645f8dd86a072a4ac32c219707eb77cca.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"70.2","high":"70.4"},"solution":"<p>\n 70.31 (70.20 - 70.40)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/4c3f522c26ec854668b51e98a0648a3ff155e0f3.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":9,"type":"MSQ","correct":"A,B,C,D","right":1,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>\n For the network shown below, the element <em>X</em> for which the two-port network is symmetrical at high frequency is represented by</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/9e297e61566200f8a9d4451877a3f22143591eb2.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> Resistance of value 2 Ω</div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> Resistance of value 1 Ω</div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> Inductor of value 0.5 H</div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> Capacitor of value 2 μF</div>","isCorrect":true}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>\n (a, b, c, d)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/3dadb5e309966dc9ab79a592dea22f510baf542f.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":10,"type":"MCQ","correct":"C","right":2,"wrong":0.66,"qtext":"<p>\n It i